on beginSprite me
  [  0] getparam 0 .............................. <me>
  [  2] getobjprop 67 ........................... <me.spriteNum>
  [  5] pusharglist 1 ........................... <me.spriteNum>
  [  7] extcall 66 .............................. <sprite(me.spriteNum)>
  [ 10] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 13] setobjprop 68 ........................... sprite(me.spriteNum).locZ = 3
  [ 16] ret
end
